1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,913
Two maps of yours are still empty of people.

2
00:00:04,813 --> 00:00:08,726
Today there's somebody in the gully to talk to,

3
00:00:09,176 --> 00:00:13,959
and something in the cistern you can't talk to at all.

4
00:00:15,759 --> 00:00:20,107
They turn out to be the same kind of record,

5
00:00:20,557 --> 00:00:22,730
with one line between them.

6
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:26,104
Pim belongs to a spot,

7
00:00:26,554 --> 00:00:29,163
so first she gets a mark.

8
00:00:30,063 --> 00:00:32,672
Then her record, under Old Marrow's.

9
00:00:34,472 --> 00:00:37,950
Area and Mark put her on the map,

10
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:41,443
the way they put a prop there.

11
00:00:42,343 --> 00:00:44,083
Sprite is her figure.

12
00:00:44,533 --> 00:00:48,446
Face is the face shown beside what she says.

13
00:00:50,246 --> 00:00:54,159
And these two lines are the ones that matter.

14
00:00:55,059 --> 00:00:56,798
Calm, and then yes,

15
00:00:57,248 --> 00:00:58,987
means she never attacks.

16
00:00:59,887 --> 00:01:05,974
And Talk scene is the key of the room a click on her opens.

17
00:01:07,774 --> 00:01:09,948
A person says Talk scene,

18
00:01:10,398 --> 00:01:12,572
and a prop says Scene.

19
00:01:13,022 --> 00:01:16,500
Lint tells you if you mix them up.

20
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:21,613
Her rooms go at the end of the file,

21
00:01:22,063 --> 00:01:24,672
and there's nothing new in them.

22
00:01:25,572 --> 00:01:29,050
She came out here to start the pump,

23
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:32,109
and something below took her tablet.

24
00:01:33,909 --> 00:01:38,257
Next lecture gives her a great deal more to say.

25
00:01:39,457 --> 00:01:42,065
Now the crawler, under the sentry.

26
00:01:42,965 --> 00:01:44,704
Look at what's missing.

27
00:01:45,154 --> 00:01:46,893
There's no Calm line,

28
00:01:47,343 --> 00:01:51,257
and that's all it takes to make a hostile.

29
00:01:53,057 --> 00:01:56,535
HP is how much hurt it can take.

30
00:01:57,435 --> 00:02:01,348
Damage is how much it does with each strike.

31
00:02:02,248 --> 00:02:08,335
Notice is how close you can get before it sees you, counted in cells.

32
00:02:09,235 --> 00:02:11,843
Patrol is the walk it takes.

33
00:02:12,293 --> 00:02:15,337
And Drops is what it leaves behind.

34
00:02:17,137 --> 00:02:19,311
A hostile walks its patrol

35
00:02:19,761 --> 00:02:24,109
until a crew member is close enough and in view.

36
00:02:25,009 --> 00:02:26,748
Then it chases them,

37
00:02:27,198 --> 00:02:31,111
and strikes every two seconds from the next cell.

38
00:02:32,911 --> 00:02:35,954
So think about where you put it.

39
00:02:36,854 --> 00:02:41,202
This one keeps to the east end of the walkway,

40
00:02:41,652 --> 00:02:43,826
well away from the stairs.

41
00:02:44,276 --> 00:02:48,624
A party that arrives has room to stop and look.

42
00:02:49,824 --> 00:02:52,867
When a hostile goes down for good,

43
00:02:53,317 --> 00:02:56,361
the game sends a signal by itself.

44
00:02:57,261 --> 00:03:02,478
The name is hostile, down, and the record's key, joined with underscores.

45
00:03:04,278 --> 00:03:07,322
So a quest can wait for it,

46
00:03:07,772 --> 00:03:10,380
with no answer and no card.

47
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:15,193
This one is a side story for the engineer.

48
00:03:16,993 --> 00:03:20,907
And Leads to finally has something to point at.

49
00:03:21,357 --> 00:03:27,009
It's the key of the thing on the map this story is about.

50
00:03:28,209 --> 00:03:30,817
Every crew member carries a weapon,

51
00:03:31,267 --> 00:03:34,746
and it's the Fire app on the handheld.

52
00:03:35,646 --> 00:03:38,254
Pick a setting and press Arm,

53
00:03:38,704 --> 00:03:43,052
and the next click on the map is a shot.

54
00:03:43,952 --> 00:03:46,561
One shot, and it's safe again.

55
00:03:48,361 --> 00:03:50,535
Stun holds a hostile still.

56
00:03:51,435 --> 00:03:54,043
Cut takes one point off it.

57
00:03:54,943 --> 00:03:57,117
And full puts it down,

58
00:03:57,567 --> 00:03:59,307
whatever it had left.

59
00:04:00,207 --> 00:04:04,554
Full also destroys any thing it hits, the beacon included,

60
00:04:05,004 --> 00:04:08,048
so keep it for what's attacking you.

61
00:04:09,848 --> 00:04:12,457
The crew has three points each.

62
00:04:13,357 --> 00:04:15,096
At nothing, you're down,

63
00:04:15,546 --> 00:04:18,154
and you can't walk or act.

64
00:04:19,954 --> 00:04:24,737
Somebody beside you with a medical kit can stand you up.

65
00:04:25,637 --> 00:04:27,811
And if everybody is down,

66
00:04:28,261 --> 00:04:32,609
the whole party wakes at the entry eight seconds later,

67
00:04:33,059 --> 00:04:34,798
with one point each.

68
00:04:36,598 --> 00:04:40,076
So nobody is ever out of the game.

69
00:04:40,526 --> 00:04:45,743
But one person alone wakes up next to whatever put them down.

70
00:04:46,943 --> 00:04:48,683
Three consoles this time.

71
00:04:49,583 --> 00:04:51,757
The doctor talks to Pim.

72
00:04:53,557 --> 00:04:57,035
Then two of them go down the stairs,

73
00:04:57,485 --> 00:04:59,659
and stop at the foot.

74
00:05:00,559 --> 00:05:03,167
Scan tells them what's in sight.

75
00:05:04,967 --> 00:05:06,707
From the weapons console:

76
00:05:07,157 --> 00:05:10,200
stun, then cut, twice, and then full.

77
00:05:11,100 --> 00:05:12,839
And down it goes.

78
00:05:13,289 --> 00:05:17,202
There's a tablet on the walkway where it fell,

79
00:05:17,652 --> 00:05:20,261
and the engineer's story is complete.

80
00:05:21,461 --> 00:05:23,635
Lint knows a lot here.

81
00:05:24,085 --> 00:05:27,128
It knows the names of those signals,

82
00:05:27,578 --> 00:05:31,491
and it knows a crawler can't stand in water.

83
00:05:33,291 --> 00:05:36,770
It can't see a missing Calm line, though.

84
00:05:37,220 --> 00:05:38,959
Leave that line out,

85
00:05:39,409 --> 00:05:43,757
and Pim attacks the first crew member who walks up.

86
00:05:44,657 --> 00:05:49,439
And it can't see a Talk scene that names no room.

87
00:05:49,889 --> 00:05:52,498
You click her, and nothing happens.

88
00:05:54,298 --> 00:05:58,211
For the exercise, make the crawler tougher, then gentler,

89
00:05:58,661 --> 00:06:00,400
and play each one.

90
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:05,243
Next time, Pim wants that tablet back.
